# Every text file checks out with LF on every OS. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# and the IPC contract fixtures (packages/shared/src/fixtures/ipc/) are compared byte for byte with
# serde's output: a CRLF checkout failed all three fixture tests on native Windows (2026-09-26).
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe mis-parses labels in LF-only batch files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
